# A third dimension that conflicts. On a triangle whose corner T1 is fixed
# and whose base S1 is level, Smart Dimension adds the length of S1 and of
# S2 at their measured values (d1, d2), then that of S3 typed 5, longer than
# the two others together: the commit leaves d3 out, and the sketch message
# names it. Esc quits the tool, a selection of S1 replaces d3's, and a click
# on the message's link selects d3 again.
open tests/data/sketch-triangle.json
wait 16
action tool.dimension
wait 2
click L 579 503
click L 579 547
wait 2
key Enter
wait 2
click L 689 339
click L 754 284
wait 2
key Enter
wait 2
click L 469 339
click L 404 284
wait 2
text "5"
wait 2
key Enter
wait 4
key Escape
wait 2
select element S1
activate status "Conflicting"
wait 2
